Note = {12h International Multidisciplinary Scientific Geoconference (SGEM),
   Albena, BULGARIA, JUN 17-23, 2012},
Organization = {Minist Environm \& Water; Bulgarian Acad Sci; Acad Sci Czech Republ;
   Acad Sci IR Iran; Latvian Acad Sci; Polish Acad Sci; Russian Acad Sci;
   Serbian Acad Sci \& Arts; Slovak Acad Sci; Natl Acad Sci Ukraine;
   Bulgarian Ind Assoc},
Abstract = {The construction process can be seen as a tool to achieve the particular
   goal - a final construction. The part of this process presents the
   eventual negative impact of construction process on the individual
   components of environment. The submitted paper is focused on the
   monitoring of environmental risks and analysis of risks perception in
   the real environment of construction process. There has been created a
   questionnaire to obtain the knowledge for this analysis. Questionnaire
   survey was attended by respondents (constructors and building site
   managers). Subsequently, the questionnaire was processed and evaluated.
   The aim of this research is to assess the impact of various types of
   construction to environment and monitoring of environmental risks during
   the construction process and the impact of environmental management
   quality system (ISO 14 001) to construction process. Next part of
   research is focused on monitoring of the most common measures to reduce
   of the negative environmental risks.},
