Abstract = {Two fastest growing technologies like the internet and mobile technology
   have driven a revolution in mobile retailing sectors. Mobility and
   flexibility become a demand nowadays since people prefer to have
   retailing concept (anytime and anywhere). This conceptual paper aimed to
   study on the discovery of factors on women's acceptance, which
   contributes to successful mobile retailing among women in Malaysia.
   Secondly, it aimed to access the extent of information, regarding the
   mobile retailing sectors, based on previous documented literature. This
   research sheds light on the body of knowledge, ultimately by looking at
   women's acceptance of mobile retail industry in Malaysia. It entails
   optimism perception as this study has broaden up strategies as well as
   the new business market for retailers that embark into the mobile
   retailing sector, by attracting more women consumers to use mobile
   retailing as a way to do online shopping.},
