Note = {International Forum on Energy, Environment and Sustainable Development
   (IFEESD), Shenzhen, PEOPLES R CHINA, APR 16-17, 2016},
Abstract = {In order to give useful information for the appropriate packaging
   conditions, respiration characteristics of fresh cut purple cabbage was
   clarified. The respiratory rate were determined by using closed system
   method. The changes of headspace gas concentrations in tank was
   determined, and the respiration rate model was established with no
   competitive inhibition Michaelis enzyme kinetics equation. The results
   showed that the respiratory rate of fresh cut purple cabbage was
   positively correlated with temperature. The lowest R-2 of the
   mathematical models of respiratory rate about fresh cut celery were 0.84
   which indicating that the model has a very good fitting. It can predict
   the change of respiratory rate from the model. It will give useful
   theoretical and technical support for gas packaging design of fresh cut
   purple cabbage.},
